WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.750
Shopping with Brightlane takes just a few steps.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:06.150
First, choose your products and add them to your cart.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.400
In Cart, check quantities and the order total.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.950
Continue to Shipping address and enter your delivery details.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.800
Next, provide your payment details, then move to Review.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.700
Check your address, payment summary, items, and totals.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.850
When you are ready, use Place order.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.600
Need to change something?

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.800
Use the navigation to return to Cart.
